  "restoration_note": "The teaching describes the body-as-city: every sense is an enthumesis with its storehouses, the heart is king/cellarer, gates have archon-watchmen, and the Mind of Light comes to take the keys. Restorations were heavily constrained by (1) the rigorously parallel sense-by-sense formula (eyes → ears → smell → taste → touch), each repeating ⲡⲥⲁⲡ ⲁⲛ ⲉⲧⲉⲣⲉ … ϣⲁⲥⲝⲓⲧϥ̄ ⲁⲍⲟⲩⲛ ⲁⲛⲉⲥⲧⲁⲙⲓⲟⲛ … ⲛ̄ⲥⲧⲉⲉϥ ⲙⲡⲉⲧϣⲓⲛⲉ ⲙⲙⲁⲥ; (2) the discourse markers Ⲧ̄ϩⲉ ϩⲱϥ ⲁⲛ ⲧⲉ ⲧⲉⲓ and Ⲥⲁⲡ ⲛⲓⲙ ⲉⲧⲟⲩⲛⲁ-; (3) the gate/encampment political vocabulary (ⲣⲱⲟⲩ, ⲁⲓⲥⲑⲏⲧⲏⲣⲓⲟⲛ, ⲍⲟⲩⲣⲉⲧⲉ, ⲡⲁⲣⲁⲙⲡⲟⲗⲏ, ⲡⲩⲣⲅⲟⲥ, ⲙⲁⲛⲣⲁⲓ̈ⲥ, ⲥⲧⲣⲁⲧⲏⲗⲁⲧⲏⲥ, ⲥⲩⲛⲃⲟⲩⲗⲓⲁ, ⲕⲉⲗⲗⲁⲣⲓⲧⲏⲥ); and (4) the Adam-and-Eve molding formula (ⲡⲉⲓⲛⲉ ⲙⲡⲡⲉⲧⲭⲁⲥⲉ, ⲧϩⲓⲕⲱⲛ ⲙⲡⲡⲣⲉⲥⲃⲉⲩⲧⲏⲥ). Lacunae too large or unconstrained to recover honestly include the wholly lost lines 19, 114–116, the long parable expansions in lines 51–52 and 145–150, and the broken cellarer continuation. Editor proposals were accepted where the Coptic and the spiritual reading converge; for line 17 'ⲁⲗⲗⲁ' completes the ⲗⲗ-traced particle; for the touch/taste sub-sections the parallel formulae from the eyes-ears sections supplied the verb chain.",
